@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white

title PROBLEMAS COMUNS

card "Pod não inicia" as p1
card "CrashLoopBackOff" as p2
card "ImagePullBackOff" as p3
card "Node NotReady" as p4
card "Service não funciona" as p5

note right of p1
  • Verificar eventos
  • Recursos insuficientes
  • Node selector/affinity
end note

note right of p2
  • Verificar logs
  • Probes falhando
  • Comando errado
end note

note right of p3
  • Imagem não existe
  • Registry credentials
  • Network issue
end note

note right of p4
  • kubelet stopped
  • Disk pressure
  • Memory pressure
end note

note right of p5
  • Selector não match
  • Endpoints vazios
  • Network Policy
end note

@enduml